#: ../../source/docs/common-NarinFC-H7.rst:231
#: 31377847838e482ea53a472adf406777
msgid "The board comes pre-installed with an ArduPilot bootloader, allowing the loading of \\*.apj firmware files with any ArduPilot compatible ground station, such as Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
